[[howto-set-active-spring-profiles]]
==== {spring} {profile} 활성화

[[howto-change-configuration-depending-on-the-environment]]
==== 환경 의존적인 구성 변경

[source,yml]
----
  server:
      port: 9000
  ---

  spring:
      profiles: dev
  server:
      port: 9001

  ---

  spring:
      profiles: prd
  server:
      port: 0
----

